  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of workers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Over the years, the Government of Ghana has been carrying out several macro-economic and structural reforms aimed at reviving the economy. Some of these policies and reforms have had serious implications for workers and members of TUC and GFL. If the workers organisations are to influence these policies to benefit its members, then they must have the capacities to do so.

The Strategy focuses on building and strengthening the capacities of workers organisations and its members through trainings, conference resolutions and improving representation in bodies dealing with policy formulation and implementation</narrative>
  </description>
